  {
    "table": "flavourtext",
    "id": "UniqueFlask18",
    "field": "Text",
    "en": "Travelers of the deep wood speak of a witch\r\nwhose ale provides a different kind\r\nof liquid courage.",
    "kind": "dat",
    "sourceHash": "28ee02f8047c1c5d05015746732e4a7dca6156deffb13ce0950429bfff31ebb7",
    "tw": "叢林深處的旅人述說著女巫\r\n她釀的酒能給你特別的\r\n借酒壯膽之勇氣。",
    "cn": "丛林深处的旅人述说着女巫\r\n她酿的酒能给你特别的\r\n借酒壮胆之勇气。"
  },
  {
    "table": "flavourtext",
    "id": "UniqueFlask38",
    "field": "Text",
    "en": "\"For as long as blood flows through your veins,\r\nso too shall this cursed brew stain your lips –\r\ndraining ever more than it restores.\"\r\n- The Coven Queen",
    "kind": "dat",
    "sourceHash": "5622f0232e93aa07e5c6201c156127bf4a195a5aa8694fa6e81ce70fbeba7c6b",
    "tw": "「只要鮮血仍在你的血管中流淌，\r\n這杯受詛咒的藥釀便會沾染你的雙唇——\r\n奪走的永遠比它恢復的更多。」\r\n- 巫會之后"
  },
  {
    "table": "words",
    "id": "hash:0d6792ea",
